00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:36.720 line:100%
MAIN TITLE

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:03.920 line:100%
Don't blame me.
Don't blame me. Don't blame me.

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:51.120 line:100%
EPISODE TITLE

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:57.200 line:20%
XINYA FASHION, CASUAL WEAR

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:10.280 line:20%
YONG'S FASHION

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:22.080 line:20%
PERSON IN CHARGE: SUN ZHENGYONG

00:04:25.400 --> 00:04:27.040 line:100%
Young man, is Mr. Sun around?

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:28.160 line:100%
I want to pick up some stock.

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:29.160 line:100%
He's gone out to restock.

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:32.040 line:100%
-When did he leave?
-No idea.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:34.240 line:100%
If you're picking up goods,
leave your pager number.

00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:49.800 line:20%
CLOSED TODAY, JUNE 30TH

00:04:49.880 --> 00:04:50.720 line:100%
Young man,

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:54.200 line:100%
why is the shop closed on June 30th?

00:04:54.280 --> 00:04:55.640 line:100%
No idea.

00:04:56.920 --> 00:04:58.560 line:100%
Whatever I ask, you don't know.

00:04:58.640 --> 00:04:59.800 line:100%
Do you work here?

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:02.560 line:100%
Mister, I only started two days ago.

00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:04.000 line:100%
I haven't even seen the boss.

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:05.960 line:100%
-You've never seen him?
-No.

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:08.120 line:100%
-Where did he go?
-No idea.

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:10.840 line:100%
His wife told me

00:05:10.920 --> 00:05:12.360 line:100%
to tell anyone who asks where he is
that he's out restocking.

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:15.200 line:100%
If they ask when he'll be back,
just say I don't know.

00:05:15.280 --> 00:05:16.880 line:100%
So I really don't know.

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:33.000 line:100%
I'm from the Nanshan Branch.
I'm here to ask a few questions.

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:35.760 line:100%
Hello, Officer. I'm Jessica.
How can I help?

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:36.840 line:100%
JESSICA

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:39.520 line:100%
I'd like to check
the sales record for this dress.

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:42.280 line:100%
B12200Y.

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:43.560 line:100%
One moment, please.

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:47.280 line:100%
BOWLS

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:49.160 line:100%
This is one of our signature pieces.

00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:51.720 line:100%
We've sold 84 pieces
since its spring launch.

00:05:52.320 --> 00:05:55.120 line:100%
-Is there a customer named Sun Zhengyong?
-Let me check.

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:02.760 line:100%
Yes. Mr. Sun is our VIP client.

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:05.640 line:100%
On May 10th, he bought 11
of the same dress.

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:07.440 line:100%
Wait, no. Twelve.

00:06:07.520 --> 00:06:09.400 line:100%
We gave him one as a freebie. Have a look.

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:12.000 line:100%
SALES DATE: MAY 10TH, SUN ZHENGYONG

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:19.000 line:100%
RETURNED 11 DRY-CLEANING VOUCHERS
RECEIVED ONE EXTRA DRESS

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:32.320 line:100%
Where's Captain Feng?
Didn't he want to see me?

00:06:32.400 --> 00:06:33.960 line:100%
Officer He, he's in a task force meeting.

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:34.920 line:100%
He told me to wait here for you.

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:36.240 line:100%
This is Jin Manlang's statement
from this afternoon.

00:06:36.320 --> 00:06:37.320 line:100%
Take a look.

00:06:37.400 --> 00:06:39.720 line:100%
He denied that anyone
had hired him to kill.

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:40.880 line:100%
He claimed he only went
after Xu Meng and her dad

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:41.960 line:100%
to collect a debt.

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:45.880 line:100%
Jin Manlang has grown a pair.
He's trying to retract his confession.

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:48.800 line:100%
Officer He, there's more.
Jin Manlang said…

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:50.680 line:100%
What else did he say? Just say it.

00:06:51.480 --> 00:06:52.480 line:100%
He said he's going to report you

00:06:52.560 --> 00:06:53.840 line:100%
for forcing a confession.

00:06:56.480 --> 00:06:58.920 line:100%
That Wolfie is unbelievable.

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:00.200 line:100%
He's pinning that on me.

00:07:00.280 --> 00:07:02.160 line:100%
Bring him in. I want
to question him face-to-face.

00:07:02.240 --> 00:07:05.120 line:100%
JIN MANLANG'S INTERROGATION RECORD

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:07.760 line:20%
JIN MANLANG, SECURITY DEPARTMENT
DEMOLITION DEPARTMENT

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:09.280 line:20%
LONGWEI GROUP

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:10.200 line:20%
2015

00:07:10.920 --> 00:07:12.040 line:100%
It isn't ripe yet.

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:13.880 line:100%
Seriously.

00:07:14.840 --> 00:07:16.040 line:100%
Pick another one for me.

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:17.760 line:100%
Just that one.

00:07:17.840 --> 00:07:18.760 line:100%
RELOCATION BENEFITS ALL
SIGN EARLY, GAIN MORE

00:07:21.760 --> 00:07:23.600 line:100%
-Give it here.
-It's not ripe. Why are you grabbing them?

00:07:23.680 --> 00:07:26.800 line:100%
Come here, I said. Be in your position.

00:07:27.520 --> 00:07:28.400 line:100%
Be in your position, okay?

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:30.400 line:100%
Keep your eyes peeled.

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:36.360 line:100%
Officer He.

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:41.120 line:100%
What brings you here, sir?

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:43.280 line:100%
Who are you?

00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:47.880 line:100%
It's me. Lang. Lang.

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:50.760 line:100%
JIN MANLANG, SECURITY DEPARTMENT
DEMOLITION DEPARTMENT

00:07:52.480 --> 00:07:53.440 line:100%
Look at you all cleaned up.

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:55.400 line:100%
You're a security manager now, huh?

00:07:55.480 --> 00:07:58.040 line:100%
What? Running forced demolitions?

00:07:58.560 --> 00:07:59.720 line:100%
No way.

00:08:00.560 --> 00:08:03.000 line:100%
We keep things civil.

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:04.840 line:100%
We don't do dirty tricks.

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:07.280 line:100%
-What brings you here, Officer He?
-I'm here to observe.

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:10.760 line:100%
Right this way. Please come in.

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:16.360 line:100%
Welcome.

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:28.840 line:100%
Everyone,

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:31.920 line:100%
please let me go over this again.

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:35.200 line:100%
Longwei Group's compensation standards

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:36.280 line:100%
have always been consistent.

00:08:36.359 --> 00:08:37.520 line:100%
Whether you move in early or late…

00:08:37.599 --> 00:08:39.560 line:100%
Didn't someone say they'd
never come, no matter what?

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:44.240 line:100%
Now, you can take a look
at the notice in your hands.

00:08:44.320 --> 00:08:47.720 line:100%
If you have any questions or doubts,

00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:49.840 line:100%
come see me at the Redevelopment Bureau.

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:50.840 line:100%
My name is Qiao Suqing.

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:51.800 line:100%
Feng,

00:08:52.320 --> 00:08:55.640 line:100%
doesn't that woman on stage look familiar?

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:58.640 line:100%
Wasn't she the mistress
from the fourth floor?

00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:02.400 line:100%
Don't believe Du's nonsense.

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:04.600 line:100%
Qiao is a decent woman.

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:06.840 line:100%
She's now the finance director
at Longwei Real Estate.

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:10.320 line:100%
She's in charge of Yuanlongli's
demolition project.

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:14.320 line:100%
Also, if any household needs help moving,

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:16.640 line:100%
we'll do what we can to assist.

00:09:18.080 --> 00:09:19.920 line:100%
The relocation service is a trap.

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:21.000 line:100%
Don't fall for it.

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:23.840 line:20%
QIAO SUQING

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:25.120 line:100%
Even a few hundred yuan would be too much.

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:49.200 line:100%
I can't talk him into it.

00:09:49.280 --> 00:09:51.040 line:100%
Qiao, you're not an outsider here.

00:09:51.120 --> 00:09:52.960 line:100%
You tell me. Should he stay or not?

00:09:56.360 --> 00:09:57.240 line:100%
Mr. He,

00:09:57.320 --> 00:09:59.440 line:100%
if even you can't convince him,

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:01.160 line:100%
I'm not in a position to say anything.

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:02.920 line:100%
Why not?

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:04.960 line:100%
He won't listen to me,

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:06.440 line:100%
but he might listen to you.

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:21.320 line:100%
You don't have to say it.

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:23.520 line:100%
I can tell from your eyes.

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:25.280 line:100%
You want him to stay.

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:31.080 line:100%
She's made herself pretty clear.

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:32.520 line:100%
Say something.

00:10:32.600 --> 00:10:35.240 line:100%
Sir, don't put her on the spot.

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:36.720 line:100%
I'm definitely going back to Beijing.

00:10:36.800 --> 00:10:37.840 line:100%
I have classes.

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:40.040 line:100%
You're the one
putting her in a tough spot.

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:42.560 line:100%
She wants you to stay.

00:10:42.640 --> 00:10:44.640 line:100%
Don't play dumb.

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:58.960 line:100%
Mr. He,

00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:02.160 line:100%
it's been so long.

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:05.160 line:100%
It's time

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:06.840 line:100%
to let go.

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:14.240 line:100%
You should let Ran go.

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:20.000 line:100%
What's wrong with you?
Why won't you ever say what you mean?

00:11:20.600 --> 00:11:21.880 line:100%
-You clearly…
-Sir,

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:23.800 line:100%
just listen to her.

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:29.520 line:100%
Ran Fangxu, as your mentor,

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:32.320 line:100%
I'm ordering you to stay in Weiyang.

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:41.880 line:100%
TRAIN TICKET: WEIYANG TO BEIJING

00:11:41.960 --> 00:11:42.920 line:100%
This is a ticket back to Beijing

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:45.120 line:100%
for tomorrow morning.

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:55.600 line:20%
Trying to walk back his own confession?

00:11:55.680 --> 00:11:56.520 line:20%
1997

00:11:59.960 --> 00:12:04.040 line:100%
SUN BOUGHT THE DRESS
I'LL CHECK THE CCTV IN YUANLONGLI. RAN

00:12:08.400 --> 00:12:10.400 line:100%
When one door closes, another opens.

00:12:10.480 --> 00:12:12.200 line:100%
There's always a way through.

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:16.280 line:100%
Captain Feng.

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:20.000 line:100%
Officer He, great job.

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:23.520 line:100%
You actually let the suspect
turn the tables on you.

00:12:25.120 --> 00:12:26.560 line:100%
Let him make the noise for now.

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:28.280 line:100%
I'll have them list
everything out soon enough.

00:12:28.360 --> 00:12:29.200 line:100%
No need to wait.

00:12:29.280 --> 00:12:31.480 line:100%
Later, head to HR

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:32.840 line:100%
and process your transfer back.

00:12:32.920 --> 00:12:35.360 line:100%
Also, get Ran over here.

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:36.680 line:100%
We're short-handed here.

00:12:38.840 --> 00:12:40.600 line:100%
Captain Feng, don't.

00:12:41.800 --> 00:12:43.640 line:100%
There's still one day left.

00:12:47.960 --> 00:12:50.360 line:100%
You're the leader.
You have to keep your word.

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:52.760 line:100%
What can you do in one day?

00:12:52.840 --> 00:12:54.440 line:100%
That's barely enough
for you to make a fuss about.

00:12:54.520 --> 00:12:57.000 line:100%
Alright. Enough messing around.

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:57.960 line:100%
Get out of my sight.

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:01.880 line:100%
Captain Feng, I know
you're not really fed up with me.

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:04.840 line:100%
You're just annoyed
about that mining case.

00:13:04.920 --> 00:13:07.760 line:100%
By the way, Ran brought in
a pickpocket yesterday.

00:13:07.840 --> 00:13:09.000 line:100%
That guy, Luandongzi.

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:11.560 line:100%
The task force should follow up on him.

00:13:15.720 --> 00:13:16.920 line:100%
-A pickpocket?
-Yeah.

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:18.920 line:100%
Ask if he's stashed a briefcase

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:20.400 line:100%
with "Qingsong Cement" on it.

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:21.960 line:100%
There's an important document inside.

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:24.200 line:100%
-That might be useful.
-He Yuanhang.

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:27.560 line:100%
Wait. What are you talking about?
What briefcase?

00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:29.360 line:100%
He Yuanhang. Get back here!

00:13:59.320 --> 00:14:00.920 line:100%
Sun Zhengyong isn't at the shop.

00:14:01.640 --> 00:14:04.480 line:100%
But I did find something. On June 30th,
he suddenly shut the place down.

00:14:04.560 --> 00:14:06.600 line:100%
That alone puts him on our radar.

00:14:06.680 --> 00:14:08.680 line:100%
Mm. I'm pulling the CCTV from the 30th

00:14:08.760 --> 00:14:11.080 line:100%
to check if he showed up
at Yuanlongli that day.

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:13.080 line:100%
Leave no stone unturned.

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:14.640 line:100%
Xinglong.

00:14:14.720 --> 00:14:16.080 line:100%
Get me all the footage
from before the 30th.

00:14:17.360 --> 00:14:18.520 line:100%
Got it.

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:21.400 line:100%
I'll make a call.

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:31.560 line:100%
-Hello?
-Hello? Qiao?

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:33.880 line:100%
-<i>Officer He.</i>
-Speaking.

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:36.880 line:100%
-Xiaohe's asleep.
-<i>She's asleep?</i>

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:38.120 line:100%
How about this?

00:14:38.200 --> 00:14:40.520 line:100%
Could you let her stay
the night at your place?

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:42.440 line:100%
I'll have her grandma
pick her up tomorrow.

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:43.560 line:100%
<i>Of course.</i>

00:14:44.160 --> 00:14:47.320 line:100%
Officer He, no need
to trouble her grandma.

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:50.080 line:100%
<i>If you're fine with it,</i>
<i>give me the address.</i>

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:51.520 line:100%
I'll send her there in the morning.

00:14:51.600 --> 00:14:53.880 line:100%
I'm totally fine with it. Of course.

00:14:53.960 --> 00:14:56.480 line:100%
<i>Write this down. The address</i>
<i>is 102, Building Unit 2,</i>

00:14:56.560 --> 00:14:58.120 line:100%
Happiness Garden.

00:14:58.200 --> 00:15:00.200 line:100%
Well, sorry to trouble you again.

00:15:00.280 --> 00:15:01.800 line:100%
Not at all.

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:04.520 line:100%
Alright, I've got the address.

00:15:04.600 --> 00:15:07.000 line:100%
I'll bring Xiaohe over
after breakfast tomorrow.

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:09.080 line:100%
-Sure. Thank you.
-<i>No problem.</i>

00:15:09.160 --> 00:15:10.000 line:100%
I'll hang up now.

00:15:11.480 --> 00:15:13.680 line:100%
I didn't know much about Qiao before.

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:18.520 line:100%
But she's really thoughtful

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:20.280 line:100%
and knows how to carry herself.

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:29.040 line:100%
There are only two people
breathing in this room.

00:15:29.120 --> 00:15:29.960 line:100%
Don't pretend you didn't hear that.

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:33.800 line:100%
I heard you. Go on.

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:36.560 line:100%
Yuanlongli

00:15:36.640 --> 00:15:39.640 line:100%
is either spreading superstitious nonsense
or making up rumors.

00:15:39.720 --> 00:15:42.040 line:100%
Qiao is a decent person.

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:44.520 line:100%
How could they smear her as a mistress?

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:47.000 line:100%
They've gone too far. That's bullying.

00:15:47.080 --> 00:15:48.360 line:100%
When I get the time,

00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:51.280 line:100%
I'm going to clean up this toxic mess.

00:15:52.440 --> 00:15:53.760 line:100%
Yeah, someone has to do that.

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:17.840 line:100%
Are you bringing in a video store here?

00:16:17.920 --> 00:16:19.560 line:100%
Didn't you say you wanted everything?

00:16:20.840 --> 00:16:22.960 line:100%
The footage from the past two weeks
is all here.

00:16:25.360 --> 00:16:26.480 line:100%
Take your time.

00:16:38.840 --> 00:16:41.760 line:100%
Xinglong, stop reading papers at night.

00:16:41.840 --> 00:16:42.760 line:100%
You'll ruin your eyes.

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:45.560 line:100%
-Oh yeah?
-Let me ask you something.

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:51.160 line:100%
We're looking for this guy.

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:52.120 line:100%
Rat-faced.

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:55.120 line:100%
-Do you recognize him?
-No.

00:16:57.000 --> 00:16:58.120 line:100%
That's fine.

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:00.560 line:100%
You can help us out.
Keep an eye out for him.

00:17:00.640 --> 00:17:02.200 line:100%
Give your eyes a break too.

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:04.840 line:100%
You call this a break?

00:17:05.680 --> 00:17:07.480 line:100%
Hey. I'm on duty here.

00:17:09.119 --> 00:17:10.919 line:100%
There's a reward if you find him.

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:14.280 line:100%
Then I'll help.

00:17:16.960 --> 00:17:17.879 line:100%
Come.

00:17:21.159 --> 00:17:22.399 line:100%
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:36.280 line:100%
If you spot anyone familiar
or suspicious, call me right away.

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:38.280 line:100%
Got it.

00:17:39.440 --> 00:17:40.640 line:100%
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:06.760 line:100%
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

00:18:26.480 --> 00:18:28.480 line:100%
No. No. My eyes are going blurry.

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:30.800 line:100%
I need to go out and get some air.

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:32.120 line:100%
My eyes are shot too.

00:18:32.840 --> 00:18:34.480 line:100%
You're young. How could your eyes be shot?

00:18:34.560 --> 00:18:36.680 line:100%
-Keep watching.
-Everything's blurry.

00:18:37.440 --> 00:18:38.280 line:100%
Keep watching.

00:18:38.360 --> 00:18:41.280 line:100%
If it gets that bad,
have Officer Ran buy you some lamb liver.

00:18:41.360 --> 00:18:42.480 line:100%
They're good for the eyes.

00:18:48.400 --> 00:18:49.360 line:100%
He.

00:18:50.760 --> 00:18:52.520 line:100%
What's wrong? Are your eyes blurry too?

00:18:52.600 --> 00:18:53.720 line:100%
It's not that. Look.

00:18:58.560 --> 00:19:00.720 line:100%
Got him? Which day?

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:03.920 line:100%
June 27th. 1:23 p.m.

00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:05.760 line:100%
That lines up. Everything lines up.

00:19:05.840 --> 00:19:07.720 line:100%
On the 27th, Sun Zhengyong

00:19:07.800 --> 00:19:09.880 line:100%
scoped out the Qihuang Clinic
on the 17th floor.

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:11.320 line:100%
He found out it had shut down.

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:12.640 line:100%
Then he tricked Xu Meng

00:19:12.720 --> 00:19:14.280 line:100%
into bringing her dad there
for treatment on the 30th.

00:19:14.360 --> 00:19:15.760 line:100%
After that, he tipped off the person

00:19:15.840 --> 00:19:19.440 line:100%
who hired Wolfie
and set him up to take the fall.

00:19:19.520 --> 00:19:20.760 line:100%
Meanwhile, he hid in the building

00:19:20.840 --> 00:19:22.640 line:100%
and waited for his chance
to move in on Xu Meng and her dad.

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:24.080 line:100%
It all checks out.

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:31.520 line:100%
But Xu Meng and her dad
took the elevator to the 18th floor.

00:19:31.600 --> 00:19:32.920 line:100%
How did he know that in advance?

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:34.560 line:100%
Isn't that obvious?

00:19:34.640 --> 00:19:37.600 line:100%
He told Xu Meng the clinic
had moved to the 18th floor.

00:19:39.920 --> 00:19:42.400 line:100%
Then how did he wipe his tracks?

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:45.080 line:100%
Why are you back
to playing "20 Questions"?

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:46.880 line:100%
I'll track down his address right now,

00:19:46.960 --> 00:19:49.400 line:100%
drag him in front of you,
and let him explain it himself.

00:19:49.480 --> 00:19:50.320 line:100%
Wait for me.

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:54.440 line:100%
If I can't find him, I…

00:19:54.520 --> 00:19:55.680 line:100%
Wait. Hold on.

00:19:56.800 --> 00:19:58.960 line:100%
Ran. He. It's him.

00:19:59.640 --> 00:20:00.560 line:100%
I… It's him!

00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:02.720 line:100%
That rat-faced guy.

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:07.040 line:100%
Which day's footage is this?

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:08.280 line:100%
This isn't footage.

00:20:08.360 --> 00:20:09.880 line:100%
It's live.

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:14.200 line:100%
Quick.

00:20:14.280 --> 00:20:15.440 line:100%
-Quick.
-Let's go.

00:20:18.680 --> 00:20:20.240 line:100%
-Seventeenth floor. Seventeenth.
-No.

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:23.360 line:100%
Get off at 16th. Hit both elevators
down to the first floor,

00:20:23.440 --> 00:20:24.840 line:100%
then take the stairs up to the 17th.

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:26.200 line:100%
We box him in from two sides.

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:31.280 line:100%
He, you're indeed an expert
in making arrests on-site.

00:20:32.600 --> 00:20:34.920 line:100%
You still have a lot more
to learn. Alright?

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:36.720 line:100%
But I don't get it.

00:20:36.800 --> 00:20:39.240 line:100%
What's he doing back
at Yuanlongli right now?

00:20:40.320 --> 00:20:41.880 line:100%
I read this somewhere.

00:20:41.960 --> 00:20:45.240 line:100%
Murderers and lovers
tend to revisit the scene.

00:20:45.320 --> 00:20:46.160 line:100%
I didn't know that.

00:20:47.440 --> 00:20:48.800 line:100%
You still have a lot more to learn.

00:21:03.720 --> 00:21:07.160 line:100%
QIHUANG CLINIC

00:21:16.560 --> 00:21:17.600 line:100%
Sun Zhengyong.

00:21:19.640 --> 00:21:20.720 line:20%
Police.

00:21:21.240 --> 00:21:24.200 line:100%
Stop. Ran, he's heading your way.

00:21:40.920 --> 00:21:41.920 line:100%
Ran Fangxu,

00:21:42.440 --> 00:21:45.440 line:100%
taking down suspects
is basic police training.

00:21:45.520 --> 00:21:47.280 line:100%
You need to get past this.

00:21:47.360 --> 00:21:48.520 line:100%
What?

00:21:55.680 --> 00:21:57.760 line:100%
How did you pass
your physical training test?

00:21:59.160 --> 00:22:01.480 line:100%
Shut up. Steady your breathing.
Face him head-on.

00:22:06.680 --> 00:22:09.040 line:100%
Horse stance. Turn into a side lunge.
Block. Trip him.

00:22:11.680 --> 00:22:14.160 line:100%
Shout. Feint a punch.
Knee strike to the abdomen.

00:22:26.080 --> 00:22:26.880 line:100%
Got him.

00:22:31.520 --> 00:22:32.560 line:100%
Still trying to run?

00:22:33.760 --> 00:22:36.360 line:100%
He, thanks for the coaching.

00:22:37.640 --> 00:22:38.520 line:100%
Have some faith.

00:22:39.560 --> 00:22:40.400 line:100%
Are you okay?

00:22:42.880 --> 00:22:48.000 line:100%
FAIR AND JUST, LOYAL AND TRUE

00:22:48.080 --> 00:22:49.000 line:100%
MIRROR

00:22:50.000 --> 00:22:51.280 line:100%
-Over here.
-Move.

00:22:59.120 --> 00:23:00.800 line:100%
-Captain Feng.
-Captain Feng.

00:23:03.120 --> 00:23:04.200 line:100%
Did you crack the case?

00:23:04.880 --> 00:23:05.720 line:100%
We still need to interrogate him.

00:23:09.000 --> 00:23:09.920 line:100%
Upstairs.

00:23:22.400 --> 00:23:23.440 line:100%
Sun Zhengyong,

00:23:24.640 --> 00:23:25.960 line:100%
let's not waste time.

00:23:26.040 --> 00:23:27.000 line:100%
Where's Xu Meng?

00:23:27.600 --> 00:23:28.440 line:100%
Xu Meng?

00:23:32.520 --> 00:23:34.440 line:100%
Do you mean Mengmeng?

00:23:34.520 --> 00:23:35.800 line:100%
Where's Mengmeng?

00:23:35.880 --> 00:23:37.560 line:100%
She took her dad and left.

00:23:37.640 --> 00:23:39.840 line:100%
They bought train tickets for July 1st.

00:23:43.200 --> 00:23:44.560 line:100%
Did you see them leave?

00:23:44.640 --> 00:23:45.600 line:100%
No.

00:23:45.680 --> 00:23:48.080 line:100%
One day, she came to me

00:23:48.760 --> 00:23:49.960 line:100%
and asked to borrow some money.

00:23:50.040 --> 00:23:51.080 line:100%
When?

00:23:51.160 --> 00:23:53.800 line:100%
Around late June.

00:23:55.000 --> 00:23:57.840 line:100%
She said someone was threatening her
and wanted her dead.

00:23:58.360 --> 00:24:00.960 line:100%
So she planned to take her dad
and get out of here for good.

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:02.440 line:100%
But she was worried

00:24:02.520 --> 00:24:04.400 line:100%
the trip would be too much for her dad.

00:24:05.000 --> 00:24:09.000 line:100%
So before leaving, she wanted
to take him to Qihuang Clinic for therapy.

00:24:09.600 --> 00:24:11.520 line:100%
She sounded so pitiful.

00:24:12.040 --> 00:24:13.360 line:100%
I lent her 30,000.

00:24:13.440 --> 00:24:14.840 line:100%
I didn't expect her

00:24:14.920 --> 00:24:17.640 line:100%
to disappear right after taking the money.

00:24:20.160 --> 00:24:22.000 line:100%
Where did you hide them?

00:24:22.080 --> 00:24:23.640 line:100%
I didn't.

00:24:26.680 --> 00:24:28.760 line:100%
Officer, did something happen

00:24:29.360 --> 00:24:30.880 line:100%
to Mengmeng?

00:24:31.880 --> 00:24:33.880 line:100%
You lent her that much money.

00:24:33.960 --> 00:24:35.200 line:100%
What's your relationship?

00:24:36.080 --> 00:24:37.240 line:100%
I like her.

00:24:37.320 --> 00:24:38.840 line:100%
How do you like her?

00:24:39.440 --> 00:24:42.840 line:100%
You know what she does for a living.

00:24:43.680 --> 00:24:45.720 line:100%
I'd book her all the time.

00:24:45.800 --> 00:24:48.320 line:100%
One day, I got drunk.

00:24:48.400 --> 00:24:50.160 line:100%
I told her I wanted to go out with her.

00:24:50.680 --> 00:24:53.800 line:100%
She thought I was talking nonsense
and turned me down.

00:24:53.880 --> 00:24:56.880 line:100%
I was mad. We got into an argument.

00:24:56.960 --> 00:24:58.400 line:100%
And then you forced yourself on her?

00:24:58.480 --> 00:25:00.040 line:100%
No, I didn't. No.

00:25:00.120 --> 00:25:03.000 line:100%
-Did you buy Xu Meng clothes?
-Yeah.

00:25:04.200 --> 00:25:05.760 line:100%
Did you give her a dress from Bowls?

00:25:05.840 --> 00:25:07.880 line:100%
Bowls?

00:25:10.880 --> 00:25:12.280 line:100%
Maybe.

00:25:13.160 --> 00:25:15.160 line:100%
I often go to malls.

00:25:15.240 --> 00:25:19.280 line:100%
When big brands go on sale, I stock up.

00:25:19.360 --> 00:25:21.720 line:100%
First, it makes good gifts for girls.

00:25:21.800 --> 00:25:23.880 line:100%
Second, I can copy the design

00:25:24.480 --> 00:25:26.040 line:100%
and get my money back.

00:25:28.640 --> 00:25:29.760 line:100%
Sun Zhengyong,

00:25:30.680 --> 00:25:31.720 line:100%
you can spin tall tales.

00:25:31.800 --> 00:25:34.720 line:100%
No matter how well you spin it,
it's still a story.

00:25:34.800 --> 00:25:36.040 line:100%
Tell me.

00:25:36.120 --> 00:25:38.880 line:100%
Why did you suddenly
shut your shop on the 30th?

00:25:38.960 --> 00:25:42.800 line:100%
And why were you on the 17th floor
of New York Block on the 27th?

00:25:43.640 --> 00:25:45.080 line:100%
Then this morning,

00:25:45.160 --> 00:25:47.120 line:100%
you went back to No. 1713 again.

00:25:47.200 --> 00:25:48.560 line:100%
And you ran when you saw us.

00:25:48.640 --> 00:25:51.160 line:100%
Try making up a story for all that.

00:25:55.960 --> 00:25:56.920 line:100%
Feeling guilty?

00:25:58.000 --> 00:25:59.120 line:100%
Go on.

00:25:59.640 --> 00:26:01.680 line:100%
I have plenty more evidence
to help you fill in the blanks.

00:26:01.760 --> 00:26:02.720 line:100%
I…

00:26:03.480 --> 00:26:04.600 line:100%
I can't hold it anymore.

00:26:04.680 --> 00:26:07.280 line:100%
Then talk. Where's Xu Meng?

00:26:07.360 --> 00:26:08.600 line:100%
That's not what I meant.

00:26:09.440 --> 00:26:10.800 line:100%
I need the bathroom.

00:26:11.520 --> 00:26:13.640 line:100%
I have prostate issues.

00:26:13.720 --> 00:26:15.080 line:100%
I can't hold it in.

00:26:15.160 --> 00:26:18.800 line:100%
And just now, this officer kicked me.

00:26:18.880 --> 00:26:21.120 line:100%
I really can't take it anymore.

00:26:25.320 --> 00:26:27.200 line:100%
I'm about to burst.

00:26:31.320 --> 00:26:34.320 line:100%
DUTY AND SELF-RESTRAINT
RIGHTEOUSNESS AND PEACE

00:26:34.400 --> 00:26:35.240 line:100%
Look who it is.

00:26:35.320 --> 00:26:37.160 line:100%
The famous Officer He.

00:26:37.880 --> 00:26:39.160 line:100%
Still with the Criminal Department?

00:26:39.240 --> 00:26:40.680 line:100%
Not coming back?

00:26:40.760 --> 00:26:42.680 line:100%
Of course. This is
where the big cases are.

00:26:42.760 --> 00:26:46.400 line:100%
Unlike someone who couldn't
even handle public order.

00:26:46.480 --> 00:26:47.600 line:100%
Keep bragging. Go on.

00:26:47.680 --> 00:26:48.960 line:100%
Big cases? How big?

00:26:49.040 --> 00:26:50.280 line:100%
Bigger than a task force case?

00:26:50.360 --> 00:26:52.400 line:100%
Do you have to give proper case briefings?

00:26:52.480 --> 00:26:54.320 line:100%
You're just someone
stringing up police tape,

00:26:54.400 --> 00:26:55.640 line:100%
and now you're talking
task force briefings?

00:26:55.720 --> 00:26:57.200 line:100%
You sure have a knack
for blowing your own trumpet.

00:26:57.280 --> 00:26:58.280 line:100%
And you're any better?

00:26:58.360 --> 00:27:00.480 line:100%
Still chasing that prank case, aren't you?

00:27:00.560 --> 00:27:02.280 line:100%
Come on. Let me see.
What big suspect did you catch?

00:27:04.200 --> 00:27:05.320 line:100%
Officer Qu.

00:27:06.080 --> 00:27:08.440 line:100%
He Yuanhang, are you trying to amuse me?

00:27:09.280 --> 00:27:10.720 line:100%
A criminal investigator like you

00:27:10.800 --> 00:27:12.520 line:100%
is actually busting
a street vendor selling fakes?

00:27:14.680 --> 00:27:16.400 line:100%
Officer Qu, do you know this guy?

00:27:17.000 --> 00:27:18.240 line:100%
He's Mr. Sun.

00:27:18.320 --> 00:27:20.880 line:100%
He shows up at the station twice a week.

00:27:20.960 --> 00:27:22.040 line:100%
Busier than Officer He.

00:27:23.080 --> 00:27:23.920 line:100%
A week?

00:27:24.000 --> 00:27:26.240 line:100%
-When was he brought in?
-Last week.

00:27:26.880 --> 00:27:28.160 line:100%
June 29th.

00:27:28.240 --> 00:27:30.440 line:100%
He was selling counterfeit goods
and got into a fight.

00:27:30.520 --> 00:27:32.600 line:100%
He was brought in and held for five days.

00:27:39.120 --> 00:27:42.480 line:100%
You suspect he has something to do
with that prank case?

00:27:45.120 --> 00:27:47.600 line:100%
I can vouch for him. It wasn't him.

00:27:48.200 --> 00:27:49.120 line:100%
He didn't have the time.

00:27:58.400 --> 00:28:02.760 line:100%
Officer, if I don't go now,
I'm going to piss myself.

00:28:05.800 --> 00:28:09.200 line:100%
DUTY AND SELF-RESTRAINT
RIGHTEOUSNESS AND PEACE

00:28:16.320 --> 00:28:17.480 line:100%
Officer,

00:28:18.120 --> 00:28:19.960 line:100%
about the first question from earlier,

00:28:20.040 --> 00:28:21.720 line:100%
you already know the answer.

00:28:21.800 --> 00:28:25.080 line:100%
Now I'll answer the second and third.

00:28:25.160 --> 00:28:28.840 line:100%
I ran when I saw you because I panicked.

00:28:28.920 --> 00:28:31.800 line:100%
I thought you were after
my counterfeit business.

00:28:31.880 --> 00:28:34.280 line:100%
As for the 17th floor at New York Block,

00:28:34.360 --> 00:28:37.600 line:100%
there's a tailor there I work with.

00:28:37.680 --> 00:28:40.400 line:100%
Last week, I took the fabric
to make samples.

00:28:41.000 --> 00:28:43.680 line:100%
This morning, I went to collect
the finished goods.

00:28:43.760 --> 00:28:45.760 line:100%
But when I got to the 17th,

00:28:45.840 --> 00:28:49.040 line:100%
I didn't know why, something just hit me.

00:28:49.120 --> 00:28:50.320 line:100%
I suddenly thought of Mengmeng.

00:28:51.160 --> 00:28:53.560 line:100%
So I figured I'd check out Qihuang Clinic.

00:28:53.640 --> 00:28:57.520 line:100%
I didn't know it had shut down.

00:28:57.600 --> 00:28:59.920 line:100%
Mengmeng played me.

00:29:00.000 --> 00:29:02.120 line:100%
That's enough. You don't need to go on.

00:29:02.760 --> 00:29:06.840 line:100%
You really shouldn't
get too close to unlucky people.

00:29:06.920 --> 00:29:09.160 line:100%
Bad luck spreads like a disease.

00:29:09.240 --> 00:29:11.000 line:100%
Once it sticks, it rubs off.

00:29:13.160 --> 00:29:16.800 line:100%
Officer, did Mengmeng go missing?

00:29:18.040 --> 00:29:20.120 line:100%
That might be the best outcome

00:29:20.640 --> 00:29:22.280 line:100%
for the people around her.

00:29:22.360 --> 00:29:24.800 line:100%
Enough said. Spare me the act.

00:29:24.880 --> 00:29:25.960 line:100%
You're no saint yourself.

00:29:26.040 --> 00:29:27.240 line:100%
You're too rotten
for bad luck to touch you.

00:29:29.920 --> 00:29:31.040 line:100%
Can you take these off now?

00:29:53.760 --> 00:29:55.640 line:100%
-Mr. Song.
-What is it?

00:29:55.720 --> 00:29:57.120 line:100%
Cripple Du's men were tailing me.

00:29:57.200 --> 00:29:58.720 line:100%
Just as I dug the body up,

00:29:58.800 --> 00:30:01.320 line:100%
they snatched it and took my car.

00:30:02.680 --> 00:30:05.240 line:100%
-What did you just say?
-I'm telling the truth.

00:30:05.320 --> 00:30:07.480 line:100%
Look at this. My head
has been thrashed badly.

00:30:30.360 --> 00:30:31.200 line:100%
Who sent this over?

00:30:42.720 --> 00:30:44.200 line:100%
-Who?
-<i>Song Qingsong,</i>

00:30:45.160 --> 00:30:46.560 line:100%
<i>did you see the photo?</i>

00:30:48.040 --> 00:30:50.720 line:100%
Director Li, what photo? I have no idea.

00:30:50.800 --> 00:30:52.600 line:100%
<i>Stop pretending.</i>

00:30:52.680 --> 00:30:55.080 line:100%
<i>That photo was left right at my doorstep.</i>

00:30:56.200 --> 00:30:57.080 line:100%
<i>Song Qingsong,</i>

00:30:57.600 --> 00:30:59.240 line:100%
<i>I don't care if you make dirty money.</i>

00:31:00.080 --> 00:31:01.760 line:100%
<i>But you actually killed someone.</i>

00:31:03.360 --> 00:31:05.240 line:100%
Director Li, hear me out.

00:31:05.320 --> 00:31:07.280 line:100%
<i>Someone has died! Hear you out for what?</i>

00:31:08.080 --> 00:31:10.640 line:100%
<i>Listen carefully. Go on the run.</i>

00:31:10.720 --> 00:31:12.400 line:100%
-<i>Right now.</i>
-Alright. Drop the act.

00:31:12.480 --> 00:31:13.520 line:100%
<i>What did you say?</i>

00:31:14.200 --> 00:31:16.160 line:100%
Did you get Cripple Du to take my car

00:31:17.000 --> 00:31:18.720 line:100%
and have someone seal the bid document?

00:31:18.800 --> 00:31:20.160 line:100%
<i>Song Qingsong.</i>

00:31:20.680 --> 00:31:21.440 line:100%
-<i>I…</i>
-Li.

00:31:21.520 --> 00:31:23.200 line:100%
Listen up.

00:31:23.280 --> 00:31:25.560 line:100%
I didn't burn the bid you sold me.

00:31:25.640 --> 00:31:26.840 line:100%
So here are your options.

00:31:26.920 --> 00:31:31.320 line:100%
One, I keep Dongshan Mine
and you tell Cripple Du to get lost.

00:31:31.960 --> 00:31:33.760 line:100%
Second, you return the eight million.

00:31:33.840 --> 00:31:35.760 line:100%
Otherwise, we both go down together.

00:31:35.840 --> 00:31:37.440 line:100%
We all go down together!

00:31:37.520 --> 00:31:39.080 line:100%
<i>Song Qingsong,</i>

00:31:39.160 --> 00:31:41.760 line:100%
<i>between bribery and murder,</i>
<i>which one carries the heavier sentence?</i>

00:31:41.840 --> 00:31:43.280 line:100%
<i>We're not going down together.</i>

00:31:43.360 --> 00:31:44.800 line:100%
I'm not scared!

00:31:44.880 --> 00:31:46.080 line:100%
I have money.

00:31:46.160 --> 00:31:48.000 line:100%
I could kill more and still
find someone to take the fall.

00:31:48.080 --> 00:31:50.440 line:100%
What can you do to me? What can you do?

00:31:57.400 --> 00:32:00.160 line:100%
<i>I'm not scared! I have money.</i>

00:32:00.240 --> 00:32:02.160 line:100%
<i>I could kill more and still</i>
<i>find someone to take the fall.</i>

00:32:02.240 --> 00:32:05.400 line:100%
<i>What can you do to me? What can you do?</i>

00:32:07.360 --> 00:32:09.960 line:100%
<i>I'm not scared! I have money.</i>

00:32:10.040 --> 00:32:11.720 line:100%
<i>I could kill more and still</i>
<i>find someone to take the fall.</i>

00:32:11.800 --> 00:32:14.120 line:100%
<i>What can you do to me? What can you do?</i>

00:32:15.400 --> 00:32:16.800 line:100%
<i>Song Qingsong,</i>

00:32:17.320 --> 00:32:20.160 line:100%
<i>you're not just ignorant of the law,</i>
<i>you are stupid.</i>

00:32:20.240 --> 00:32:21.080 line:100%
Son of a bitch.

00:32:21.160 --> 00:32:22.840 line:100%
You are despicable.

00:32:23.360 --> 00:32:25.560 line:100%
<i>Now I'll give you two options.</i>

00:32:25.640 --> 00:32:26.880 line:100%
<i>One, I burn the photo,</i>

00:32:27.560 --> 00:32:28.520 line:100%
<i>you go out and lie low for a while.</i>

00:32:29.120 --> 00:32:32.800 line:100%
<i>Two, I hand the photo and the recording</i>
<i>over to the police.</i>

00:32:33.320 --> 00:32:36.680 line:100%
<i>Keep both your money and your life</i>
<i>or lose everything. Your call.</i>

00:32:38.960 --> 00:32:41.160 line:100%
Mr… Mr. Song. Mr. Song. Mr. Song.

00:32:41.240 --> 00:32:43.960 line:100%
I was wrong. Mr. Song. Forgive me.

00:32:44.480 --> 00:32:46.800 line:100%
-It's my fault.
-All of you

00:32:47.600 --> 00:32:49.200 line:100%
are trying to screw me over.

00:32:49.280 --> 00:32:51.280 line:100%
Mr. Song. Forgive me.

00:33:23.280 --> 00:33:25.080 line:20%
WEIYANG CITY DONGSHAN MINE BID DOCUMENT

00:33:35.960 --> 00:33:37.800 line:100%
Book me two tickets to Los Angeles.

00:33:38.680 --> 00:33:39.840 line:100%
As soon as possible.

00:33:40.480 --> 00:33:42.680 line:100%
<i>Got it, Mr. Song. Who's going with you?</i>

00:33:51.120 --> 00:33:53.920 line:100%
QINGSONG CEMENT FACTORY, WEIYANG CITY

00:33:56.400 --> 00:33:59.240 line:100%
QINGSONG CEMENT FACTORY

00:34:09.880 --> 00:34:12.039 line:100%
Mr. Song. Cripple Du's men are here.

00:34:13.720 --> 00:34:14.560 line:100%
Go.

00:34:17.200 --> 00:34:18.760 line:100%
-Stop!
-Don't run!

00:34:18.840 --> 00:34:20.479 line:100%
-Stay there!
-Don't run!

00:34:27.640 --> 00:34:28.999 line:100%
Qingsong. Take the back door.

00:34:29.080 --> 00:34:30.039 line:100%
We leave together.

00:34:30.120 --> 00:34:32.160 line:100%
Too late. We don't have time. Qingsong.

00:34:32.240 --> 00:34:34.080 line:100%
Don't worry, Qingsong.
The police won't trace it here.

00:34:34.160 --> 00:34:36.840 line:100%
Even if they do,
I'll take the fall. Go now.

00:34:38.039 --> 00:34:39.920 line:100%
As long as you, my sister,
and your child are safe,

00:34:39.999 --> 00:34:41.479 line:100%
even if I take a bullet for it,

00:34:41.560 --> 00:34:42.840 line:100%
it'll be worth it.

00:34:42.920 --> 00:34:46.120 line:100%
Shanlong, after I'm gone,
you're the factory director.

00:34:46.720 --> 00:34:48.039 line:100%
Take care of everything for me.

00:34:48.640 --> 00:34:51.200 line:100%
-Qingsong, go. Qingsong, go.
-I'll be back.

00:34:51.280 --> 00:34:52.800 line:100%
-I'll be back.
-Go, Qingsong.

00:34:52.880 --> 00:34:54.720 line:100%
Qingsong, go.

00:34:58.320 --> 00:34:59.440 line:100%
Fucking hell!

00:35:07.000 --> 00:35:09.520 line:100%
Stop! Stop! Stop!

00:35:23.440 --> 00:35:25.520 line:100%
I paid you to put on a show.

00:35:26.040 --> 00:35:27.920 line:100%
You're actually beating me?

00:35:28.000 --> 00:35:31.320 line:100%
For real? How dare you!

00:35:31.400 --> 00:35:32.360 line:100%
Fuck.

00:35:32.440 --> 00:35:34.280 line:100%
Motherfuckers.

00:35:36.760 --> 00:35:38.200 line:100%
Can you be professional?

00:36:23.280 --> 00:36:24.840 line:100%
You got lucky this time.

00:36:25.600 --> 00:36:27.840 line:100%
It's not going to happen a third time.

00:36:47.880 --> 00:36:53.040 line:100%
FAIR AND JUST, LOYAL AND TRUE

00:36:53.120 --> 00:36:55.680 line:100%
INTERROGATION ROOM

00:37:02.400 --> 00:37:04.200 line:100%
I was trying to prove myself.

00:37:04.280 --> 00:37:05.480 line:100%
But then,

00:37:06.160 --> 00:37:07.960 line:100%
I proved I was a fool.

00:37:10.840 --> 00:37:13.360 line:100%
Now our only lead is Song Qingsong.

00:37:15.600 --> 00:37:18.600 line:100%
-Let's go.
-Hurry up. Quit dragging your feet.

00:37:19.280 --> 00:37:21.240 line:100%
Officer, my leg hurts.

00:37:21.320 --> 00:37:22.400 line:100%
Wu Shanlong?

00:37:23.320 --> 00:37:26.200 line:100%
FAIR AND JUST

00:37:27.360 --> 00:37:28.640 line:100%
Good day, officers.

00:37:29.400 --> 00:37:31.400 line:100%
-What's he in for?
-It's a misunderstanding.

00:37:31.920 --> 00:37:33.800 line:100%
-Misunderstanding.
-Did they ask you?

00:37:35.080 --> 00:37:38.200 line:100%
It's about Dongshan Mine.
We'll need to question him further.

00:37:38.280 --> 00:37:39.400 line:100%
Have you arrested Song Qingsong?

00:37:39.480 --> 00:37:40.720 line:100%
Reporting, sir.

00:37:41.480 --> 00:37:42.440 line:100%
From now on,

00:37:42.520 --> 00:37:44.720 line:100%
there'll be no more
Song Qingsong in Weiyang.

00:37:44.800 --> 00:37:46.000 line:100%
End of report.

00:37:47.880 --> 00:37:48.880 line:100%
Move.

00:37:59.760 --> 00:38:03.800 line:20%
RUICHUAN RESTAURANT

00:38:05.280 --> 00:38:06.840 line:100%
One faked you out,

00:38:07.360 --> 00:38:08.600 line:100%
the other got away.

00:38:09.480 --> 00:38:12.800 line:100%
These two are cunning.

00:38:14.080 --> 00:38:15.120 line:100%
Stop reading.

00:38:15.720 --> 00:38:16.560 line:100%
He got away.

00:38:16.640 --> 00:38:18.200 line:100%
What's the point of staring
at the notebook?

00:38:18.280 --> 00:38:19.360 line:100%
Eat the noodles. Come on.

00:38:24.240 --> 00:38:25.600 line:100%
Stop reading.

00:38:25.680 --> 00:38:26.880 line:100%
Listen.

00:38:26.960 --> 00:38:28.840 line:100%
We're putting this case on hold for now.

00:38:28.920 --> 00:38:31.040 line:100%
I've talked to Captain Feng.

00:38:31.120 --> 00:38:32.160 line:100%
After this meal,

00:38:32.240 --> 00:38:33.800 line:100%
you report to the Task Force.

00:38:33.880 --> 00:38:34.880 line:100%
As for me,

00:38:35.640 --> 00:38:37.000 line:100%
I'm going back to the station.

00:38:54.040 --> 00:38:54.960 line:100%
He,

00:38:56.320 --> 00:38:57.200 line:100%
are you backing out?

00:38:59.720 --> 00:39:01.400 line:100%
How can you call this backing out?

00:39:01.480 --> 00:39:04.880 line:100%
This is getting back to where we belong
and doing our part.

00:39:04.960 --> 00:39:06.280 line:100%
Getting back is backing out.

00:39:08.200 --> 00:39:10.680 line:100%
We've taken a beating over a missing case
that hasn't even been filed.

00:39:10.760 --> 00:39:13.320 line:100%
And now you say don't back out,
tell me how we move forward.

00:39:14.360 --> 00:39:16.440 line:100%
Besides, we had an agreement
with Captain Feng.

00:39:16.520 --> 00:39:19.520 line:100%
Today's the third day.
We have to keep our word.

00:39:20.440 --> 00:39:21.360 line:100%
We still have tonight.

00:39:22.360 --> 00:39:24.880 line:100%
Ran Fangxu, are you stupid or what?

00:39:25.840 --> 00:39:27.760 line:100%
The task force has brought in Wu Shanlong.

00:39:27.840 --> 00:39:29.840 line:100%
If you don't report in now,
forget the credit,

00:39:29.920 --> 00:39:31.440 line:100%
you won't even get a shred of it.

00:39:31.520 --> 00:39:33.720 line:100%
I didn't become a cop for credit.

00:39:33.800 --> 00:39:36.280 line:100%
I owe Xu Meng and her dad the truth.

00:39:51.040 --> 00:39:53.840 line:100%
He, after everything we've done,

00:39:54.600 --> 00:39:57.240 line:100%
if we pull out now,
it'll all be for nothing.

00:39:57.760 --> 00:39:59.000 line:100%
Let me tell you this.

00:40:00.440 --> 00:40:03.680 line:100%
I've lived long enough to learn one thing.

00:40:04.280 --> 00:40:05.720 line:100%
Don't get too hung up on things.

00:40:05.800 --> 00:40:07.640 line:100%
Let go when you can.

00:40:07.720 --> 00:40:10.280 line:100%
Or else, you'll drive yourself crazy.

00:40:27.760 --> 00:40:29.920 line:100%
Looks like my first case

00:40:31.160 --> 00:40:32.520 line:100%
is going to end in failure.

00:40:40.240 --> 00:40:42.480 line:100%
Ever since I entered PPSUC,

00:40:43.240 --> 00:40:45.480 line:100%
I've been studying all kinds
of missing person cases.

00:40:47.640 --> 00:40:49.000 line:100%
I told myself that once
I became a police officer

00:40:49.800 --> 00:40:51.440 line:100%
and took on a case,

00:40:51.520 --> 00:40:53.920 line:100%
I'd find the missing person at all costs

00:40:55.080 --> 00:40:56.640 line:100%
and leave no regrets.

00:41:00.880 --> 00:41:03.640 line:100%
I thought I knew my stuff.

00:41:04.240 --> 00:41:05.880 line:100%
But when it comes to real fieldwork,

00:41:08.360 --> 00:41:09.320 line:100%
I'm nothing.

00:41:21.800 --> 00:41:22.800 line:100%
That's funny.

00:41:23.880 --> 00:41:24.920 line:100%
You know what?

00:41:26.240 --> 00:41:28.320 line:100%
My first case
was a missing persons case too.

00:41:28.400 --> 00:41:30.960 line:100%
It was an old man with dementia.

00:41:31.920 --> 00:41:33.480 line:100%
I ran around for days,

00:41:33.560 --> 00:41:35.280 line:100%
nearly wore my shoes out.

00:41:39.400 --> 00:41:40.680 line:100%
So you failed too?

00:41:44.600 --> 00:41:45.800 line:100%
I ran out of leads

00:41:46.600 --> 00:41:47.600 line:100%
and had to try something stupid.

00:42:01.320 --> 00:42:02.680 line:100%
Enough with the suspense.

00:42:03.760 --> 00:42:05.200 line:100%
No. It's not that.

00:42:06.640 --> 00:42:07.520 line:100%
Here's what I did.

00:42:08.360 --> 00:42:10.920 line:100%
I pretended to be the old man

00:42:11.000 --> 00:42:13.720 line:100%
and followed his way of thinking.

00:42:13.800 --> 00:42:14.680 line:100%
I wandered around aimlessly.

00:42:14.760 --> 00:42:17.160 line:100%
When I was hungry,
I grabbed whatever I could find.

00:42:17.240 --> 00:42:18.560 line:100%
When I needed to pee,

00:42:18.640 --> 00:42:19.800 line:100%
I just went wherever.

00:42:21.280 --> 00:42:22.160 line:100%
And in the end,

00:42:22.240 --> 00:42:24.320 line:100%
I actually found him.

00:42:28.160 --> 00:42:29.600 line:100%
He.

00:42:29.680 --> 00:42:31.600 line:100%
That's basically immersive roleplay.

00:42:34.080 --> 00:42:35.880 line:100%
Yeah. Right.

00:42:37.480 --> 00:42:38.400 line:100%
I came up with this myself

00:42:39.520 --> 00:42:41.160 line:100%
22 years before you.

00:42:46.120 --> 00:42:49.040 line:100%
How about we…

00:42:54.880 --> 00:42:56.160 line:100%
No way.

00:42:59.200 --> 00:43:00.560 line:100%
Listen.

00:43:00.640 --> 00:43:01.920 line:100%
If you want to do that, go ahead.

00:43:02.000 --> 00:43:04.120 line:100%
Anyone who goes with you
is out of their mind.

00:43:09.760 --> 00:43:10.760 line:100%
NOTEBOOK

00:43:47.680 --> 00:43:49.560 line:100%
Can you not breathe all over me?

00:43:49.640 --> 00:43:50.680 line:100%
What?

00:43:51.200 --> 00:43:54.120 line:100%
That old man in the footage
kept his head down like this.

00:43:55.200 --> 00:43:57.040 line:100%
You smell like garlic.

00:43:57.120 --> 00:43:59.120 line:100%
Focus on your job.

00:44:17.760 --> 00:44:20.160 line:100%
Focus on your job. Lean back.

00:44:20.240 --> 00:44:21.600 line:100%
You're getting back at me.

00:44:38.160 --> 00:44:40.000 line:100%
Why are your legs shaking?

00:44:40.080 --> 00:44:42.240 line:100%
You should lose some weight.

00:44:42.320 --> 00:44:43.520 line:100%
If you can't handle it, I'll switch.

00:44:43.600 --> 00:44:45.000 line:100%
Don't move.

00:44:45.080 --> 00:44:47.240 line:100%
If we can't get it right this time,
we run it again.

00:44:52.240 --> 00:44:54.120 line:100%
-I'm taking my jacket off.
-Steady.

00:45:04.520 --> 00:45:05.640 line:20%
PRIVATE ROOM 1

00:45:06.680 --> 00:45:07.680 line:100%
Hey.

00:45:07.760 --> 00:45:09.960 line:100%
Have you picked up anything so far?

00:45:10.680 --> 00:45:11.600 line:100%
No.

00:45:12.120 --> 00:45:14.640 line:100%
Have you felt anything back there?

00:45:15.400 --> 00:45:16.400 line:100%
I have.

00:45:17.160 --> 00:45:18.040 line:100%
What is it?

00:45:18.120 --> 00:45:20.200 line:100%
Xu Meng has better stamina than you.

00:45:28.760 --> 00:45:29.840 line:100%
I may not have gone to the Police Academy,

00:45:30.560 --> 00:45:32.760 line:100%
but I've been a cop for 22 years.

00:45:32.840 --> 00:45:34.960 line:100%
I have my own ways of working things out.

00:45:35.560 --> 00:45:36.480 line:100%
Let's hear it.

00:45:37.320 --> 00:45:39.720 line:100%
Everything is always changing.
We only have so much energy.

00:45:39.800 --> 00:45:41.200 line:100%
Focus on the big picture.
Don't dwell on the small stuff.

00:45:41.280 --> 00:45:42.840 line:100%
Dress well, eat well.

00:45:43.440 --> 00:45:44.320 line:100%
I understand the first three.

00:45:45.000 --> 00:45:46.640 line:100%
What's that last one supposed to mean?

00:45:47.160 --> 00:45:50.040 line:100%
Simple. What can't you live without?

00:45:50.120 --> 00:45:51.400 line:100%
Eat, drink, sleep, and poop.

00:45:51.480 --> 00:45:52.960 line:100%
It's in those everyday things

00:45:53.040 --> 00:45:54.480 line:100%
that people slip up and leave traces.

00:45:54.560 --> 00:45:56.440 line:100%
Take this cola.

00:45:56.520 --> 00:45:58.760 line:100%
You pop it open, and it sprays everywhere.
You shake it off, right?

00:45:58.840 --> 00:46:02.680 line:100%
And when you do, you leave a trail. Right?

00:46:04.880 --> 00:46:05.960 line:100%
What are you looking at?

00:46:06.040 --> 00:46:08.680 line:100%
He. Look. What's that?

00:46:11.640 --> 00:46:14.280 line:100%
Isn't that where I shook off
the cola last time?

00:46:14.360 --> 00:46:15.480 line:100%
No.

00:46:15.560 --> 00:46:17.280 line:100%
Look higher. Up there.

00:46:25.400 --> 00:46:26.560 line:100%
In the CCTV,

00:46:26.640 --> 00:46:28.800 line:100%
Xu Meng's dad was holding a cigarette.

00:46:28.880 --> 00:46:30.160 line:100%
He has a lung condition.

00:46:30.240 --> 00:46:31.560 line:100%
<i>Why would he be smoking?</i>

00:47:14.560 --> 00:47:16.440 line:100%
Easy. Stay calm.